  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations World Food Programme (WFP) core contributions 2022-23 to 2025-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia - World Food Programme Strategic Partnership Framework (SPF) sets the objectives and obligations for partnership. It outlines the parameters for Australia&apos;s global funding, and the requirements for any subsidiary arrangements that will direct funding to specific crises/programmes.

This investment delivers Australia&apos;s core funding contributions under the current Strategic Partnership Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
